{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14850","headline":"宴席赋得姚美人拍筝歌 · 卢纶","name":"宴席赋得姚美人拍筝歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出帘仍有钿筝随，见罢翻令恨识迟。\n微收皓腕缠红袖，深遏朱弦低翠眉。\n忽然高张应繁节，玉指回旋若飞雪。\n凤箫韶管寂不喧，绣幕纱窗俨秋月。\n有时轻弄和郎歌，慢处声迟情更多。\n已愁红脸能佯醉，又恐朱门难再过。\n昭阳伴里最聪明，出到人间才长成。\n遥知禁曲难翻处，犹是君王说小名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}